filters.description:
Advanced filter conditions with nested array structure.

Required format:
{
  "filters": [
    {
      "attribute": {"slug": "field_name"}, 
      "condition": "operator", 
      "value": "search_value"
    }
  ]
}

Simple attribute filtering:
- By stage: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "stage"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "Demo"}]}
- By value: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "value"}, "condition": "greater_than", "value": 5000}]}

Reference attribute filtering (owner, assignee, company, person):
- By UUID: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "owner"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "uuid-here"}]}
- By name: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "owner"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "Martin Kessler"}]}
- By email: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "owner"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "user@example.com"}]}

Numeric comparisons:
- Greater than: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "value"}, "condition": "greater_than", "value": 50000}]}
- Less than or equal: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "employees"}, "condition": "less_than_or_equals", "value": 100}]}
- Between (combine filters): {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "value"}, "condition": "greater_than", "value": 10000}, {"attribute": {"slug": "value"}, "condition": "less_than", "value": 100000}]}

Empty value conditions:
- Check if empty: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "notes"}, "condition": "is_empty", "value": true}]}
- Check if not empty: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "description"}, "condition": "is_not_empty", "value": true}]}

String operations:
- Contains: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "name"}, "condition": "contains", "value": "Tech"}]}
- Starts with: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "domain"}, "condition": "starts_with", "value": "www"}]}
- Ends with: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "email"}, "condition": "ends_with", "value": "@gmail.com"}]}

Combined filters:
- Stage + Owner: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "stage"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "Demo"}, {"attribute": {"slug": "owner"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "uuid-or-name"}]}
- OR logic: {"filters": [...], "matchAny": true}
- Complex: {"filters": [{"attribute": {"slug": "stage"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "Qualified"}, {"attribute": {"slug": "value"}, "condition": "greater_than", "value": 25000}, {"attribute": {"slug": "owner"}, "condition": "equals", "value": "Martin Kessler"}]}

Supported canonical conditions: equals, contains, starts_with, ends_with, gt, gte, lt, lte, is_empty, is_not_empty
Also accepted aliases: eq, greater_than, greater_than_or_equals, less_than, less_than_or_equals, not_empty, $gt, $gte, $lt, $lte
